{"id":"8f8c5722fd8d964f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md","title":"Normal Function","display":"df-normalfunction — Normal Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-normalfunction","aliases":["58-df-normalfunction"],"display":"df-normalfunction — Normal Function","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-normalfunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-normalfunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normalfunction — Normal Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (class graph on the ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\\)</span> (ordinal class and limit-ordinal predicate, see dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (class-level normal-function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normalfunction}\\vdash\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists!\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F\\land\\langle\\beta,\\delta\\rangle\\in F\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\n\\to\\gamma\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\lambda)\\land\\langle\\lambda,\\eta\\rangle\\in F\n\\to\\eta=\\bigcup\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle\\xi,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normalfunction}\\vdash\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists!\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F\\land\\langle\\beta,\\delta\\rangle\\in F\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\n\\to\\gamma\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\lambda)\\land\\langle\\lambda,\\eta\\rangle\\in F\n\\to\\eta=\\bigcup\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle\\xi,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is represented as a definable class graph. No set function is asserted to have the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> as domain or codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)$ (definable-class predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normalfunction}\\vdash\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists!\\beta\